{"id": "public-access-cable-fund", "title": "What happened to nine years of cable-access revenue?", "seconds": 50.8, "voice": "elevenlabs:9PVP7ENhDskL0KYHAKtD", "narrator": "Jerry B.", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "11cd3a0ed3819169", "words": 145, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "For nine years, cable access revenue exceeded spending. This is an investigative lead.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.09, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Nine", "years"], "sub": "Cable-access revenue exceeded recorded spending for nine years"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.43, 0.87, 1.21, 1.6, 2.0, 2.4, 3.38, 3.61, 3.73, 3.83, 4.56]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The operating difference reached $10.4 million.", "t0": 5.21, "t1": 8.18, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "ledger", "layout": "table", "heading": "Nine fiscal years", "context": "Operating ledger, 2018–2026", "rows": [{"label": "Revenue", "value": "$21,487,641.82"}, {"label": "Spending", "value": "$11,050,854.64"}, {"label": "Difference", "value": "$10,436,787.18"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.64, 1.04, 1.31, 1.57, 1.86, 2.15, 2.52]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The ledger leaves out balances carried forward. It cannot tell us how much was available.", "t0": 8.3, "t1": 13.13, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "ledger", "kicker": "Cable-access revenue exceeded recorded spending for nine years", "text": "What the ledger excludes", "mark": "What"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.51, 0.76, 0.95, 1.44, 1.77, 2.66, 2.84, 3.27, 3.55, 3.7, 3.91, 4.14, 4.31]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The City directs unappropriated balances to its General Fund at year end.", "t0": 13.35, "t1": 17.4, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "fund", "kicker": "The year-end rule depends on whether money was appropriated", "text": "Year-end rule", "mark": "Year-end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.45, 0.93, 1.83, 2.34, 2.55, 2.7, 3.05, 3.37, 3.47, 3.74]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "One original budget designated $55,000. The actual transfer is unverified.", "t0": 17.52, "t1": 22.84, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "fund", "kicker": "The year-end rule depends on whether money was appropriated", "text": "Committed funds", "mark": "Committed"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.64, 0.99, 1.57, 2.22, 2.6, 3.42, 3.61, 3.94, 4.45, 4.57]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "We also found two different rates in the ordinance.", "t0": 22.96, "t1": 25.33, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "fee", "kicker": "The enacted rate contains two different numbers", "text": "Two rates in one sentence", "mark": "Two"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.62, 0.91, 1.1, 1.42, 1.69, 1.78, 1.91]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "It spells out one and one-fifteenth percent, but prints 1.15 percent.", "t0": 25.45, "t1": 29.93, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "fee", "layout": "table", "heading": "One ordinance", "context": "Section 11.28-A", "rows": [{"label": "Written fraction", "value": "1.0667%"}, {"label": "Decimal", "value": "1.15%"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.52, 0.73, 0.92, 1.06, 1.71, 2.45, 2.68, 3.04, 3.3, 3.61, 3.82, 4.1]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The City’s fee schedule uses the decimal.", "t0": 30.05, "t1": 32.13, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "fee", "kicker": "The enacted rate contains two different numbers", "text": "Fee schedule", "mark": "Fee"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.47, 0.64, 1.18, 1.48, 1.61]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "In 2023 the Controller proposed closing out a cable capital project.", "t0": 32.25, "t1": 36.33, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "letter", "kicker": "The Controller identified a cable capital project for closeout", "text": "Proposed project closeout", "mark": "Proposed"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.47, 1.05, 1.18, 1.69, 2.1, 2.52, 2.7, 2.79, 3.14, 3.53]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The budget gave general authority. The final project entry is still missing.", "t0": 36.45, "t1": 40.46, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "letter", "layout": "table", "heading": "2023 closeout", "context": "Cable Franchise Capital", "rows": [{"label": "Proposed", "value": "$2,583,169"}, {"label": "Closing entry", "value": "Unverified"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.5, 0.75, 1.07, 2.08, 2.24, 2.55, 2.97, 3.26, 3.35, 3.62]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The next two budgets keep money for grants, equipment and City services.", "t0": 40.68, "t1": 44.28, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "budget26", "layout": "table", "heading": "Operating appropriations", "context": "Fund 12500", "rows": [{"label": "2025–26", "value": "$1,660,000"}, {"label": "2026–27", "value": "$1,490,000"}, {"label": "2027–28", "value": "$1,380,000"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.36, 0.56, 0.96, 1.19, 1.43, 1.59, 2.11, 2.61, 2.73, 3.01]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The year-end accounts would show what remained available to transfer.", "t0": 44.4, "t1": 47.39, "shot": "s11", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Year-end balances"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.53, 0.93, 1.1, 1.33, 1.53, 1.88, 2.35, 2.46]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "A lead is a question, not an accusation.", "t0": 47.51, "t1": 49.86, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.38, 0.5, 0.58, 1.3, 1.53, 1.63]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "Cable-access revenue exceeded recorded spending for nine years", "b": "The year-end rule depends on whether money was appropriated", "o": "The adopted budgets document continuing commitments"}, "look": "dossier", "hook": "document"}